{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:6d2535c4072f2ec2","name":"N-1 Royal Starfighter","source":{"id":"source:reference-6d2535c4072f2ec2","title":"N-1 Royal Starfighter","revision":18758,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:40:59Z","sha256":"2270073f19e70b02358c7ac6ae04d71130b143cfdbeba2fe4abcddd76f3f8e46","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18758","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=N-1%20Royal%20Starfighter&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-6d2535c4072f2ec2","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Naboo Resistance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Naboo_Resistance","referenceId":"reference:3b298416f94cfef7"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["An example of the beauty and artistry of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," people, the N-1 Royal Starfighter is the premier space combat vessel for the security volunteers of that tranquil world. Designed to be aesthetically pleasing as well as economically friendly, the N-1 Starfighter was a moderately armed space combat vessel created to protect ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," and the space around it from pirates and raiders. Despite the pleasing appearance of the N-1, the vessel is a capable defense fighter that sees a surprising amount of action while protecting the peaceful world of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Each N-1 Starfighter is embellished with a chromium coating on the nose and forward sections of the engines, a sign that it is a part of the Naboo Royal House. Primarily used for defensive missions, the N-1 Starfighter also serves as part of the monarchy's honor guard when traveling abroad, escorting the royal transport ships throughout the galaxy. N-1 Starfighters are sometimes loaned to VIPs and other important visitors to escort their Starships while in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," system, though this is a relatively rare occurrence.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Unlike many other planetary defense fighters, the N-1 Royal Starfighter is equipped with powerful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Systems"},". Despite its outward appearance as a piece of art, the N-1 carries ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannons"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Proton Torpedoes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Proton_Torpedoes","referenceId":"reference:89c41c332c03f2dd"}," that rival those used by strictly military vessels. The mere presence of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Proton Torpedoes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Proton_Torpedoes","referenceId":"reference:89c41c332c03f2dd"}," puts the vessel in a higher class of combat ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"},", allowing it to drive off raiders that have competitive weaponry. Though N-1 pilots are not always the most experienced, the weapons aboard the ship can usually make up for the discrepancy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["At first glance, the N-1's offensive capabilities seem out of place for a world where war and violence are eschewed. However, the N-1 is used as a vehicle of deterrence, responding to attacks by pirates and raiders with enough force to encourage enemies to seek out other star systems to prey upon. Additionally, the N-1 Starfighter's shields and other defensive systems are robust enough that even persistent attackers will suffer heavy casualties in the time it takes to penetrate Naboo's defenses.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["N-1 Royal Starfighter Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +5; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 15 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 11), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 22; +6 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 60; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},": 10; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},": 15; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},": 42\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Offense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]},"